    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SUMMARY:</h2><br>This is an old-school 2D RPG in the vein of Skyfall, Last Heroes and Fantasy Heroes.<br><br>The Rebellion was a great war waged against the King and his former Council Members, who betrayed him in the attempt to form and rule over a new nation. After years of bloodshed, the King won the war and exiled his enemies.<br>In what is known as The Exile Island, the Sentinels, a group of specifically trained warriors guard over the Underworld Prison that hold The Exiled. Circumstances calls them to uphold their vows and duty when The Exiled escape the prison.<br>Now the Sentinels must chase them over the Island before they can escape it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES:</h2><br>Fast paced and thrilling gameplay<br>Mouse Support<br>Quest Journal<br>Outstanding Artwork<br>Beautiful visuals<br>Exciting soundtrack<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MORE COOL GAMES:</h2><br><br><br><br><br>",
